PaymentRails_NativeAvalancheFork
├── when AVAX is sent with call
│   ├── it should accept the value
│   └── it should emit NativeReceived
├── when AVAX is sent with transfer
│   └── it should accept the value within the 2300 gas stipend
├── when wrapNative is called
│   ├── it should mint real WAVAX to the rails one to one
│   ├── it should leave zero native balance on the rails
│   └── it should move the AVAX into the WAVAX contract
├── when a non-owner calls wrapNative
│   └── it should revert
├── when the wrapped balance is executed
│   ├── it should swap WAVAX to USDC through the real SwapRouter02
│   ├── it should land within the Chainlink oracle band
│   └── it should leave the module clean
├── when wrapNative is called with nothing to wrap
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_ZeroNativeBalance
├── when the owner sweeps raw AVAX
│   ├── it should pay the whole native balance to the recipient
│   └── it should emit NativeSwept
├── when the owner sweeps with real WAVAX on the rails
│   ├── it should unwrap through the real WAVAX contract
│   ├── it should not log the WAVAX payout as a receipt
│   └── it should pay native plus unwrapped to the recipient
├── when the owner sweeps to a contract
│   └── it should deliver the value
├── when a non-owner sweeps
│   └── it should revert
├── given a rail without a wrapper
│   └── it should still let the owner sweep force-fed AVAX
└── when created by a factory built with WAVAX
    ├── it should deploy to the predicted address
    ├── it should carry WAVAX as wrappedNative
    └── it should accept and wrap AVAX
